text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 13}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n4le03ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n4le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Trevor: </span> Diego, we might need to chance our network resources. Now that our company is growing, I won't accept any type of system issue.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Diego: </span> It might take us longer than we expect to expand our current network but I'm sure the system won't experience systematic failures. Switching from PAN to LAN says a lot about the company.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Trevor: </span> Why is that?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Diego: </span> As you know, we classify networks by size. A PAN connection is smaller than a LAN connection. With LAN, the company will be able to operate better.</br>"}, {"time": "36000", "image": "enpe8n4le03ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Trevor: </span> It is always a good idea to improve our network resources.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Diego: </span> Definitely! Now we have better network support resources than before. I am working on a robust LAN computer network with intranet and extranet services. Our offices have stronger wired and wireless connections than the ones we had when we used PAN. Our internet speed won't be slow ever again and this might allow us to increase productivity. I just did a speed test, and the internet is by far faster than ever.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Trevor: </span> Excellent. What about the network support resources?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Diego: </span> The new technology we are using is more powerful. Our software is up to date and all of our units are in good conditions. We still need to make some changes; don't worry, we are within budget.</br>"}, {"time": "91000", "image": "enpe8n4le03ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Trevor: </span> Great. To sum up, we won't have to worry about systematic failures since we expanded our network. We might need to invest money periodically to make sure that our network resources such as our databases, hardware, and software work properly. Now, we are working with a LAN, when we become a big multinational, we will switch to MAN which covers an expanse twenty times bigger.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Diego: </span> That's the plan.<br/>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n4le03ob05re5vqz01pt1", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 4, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n4le03ob05re5vqz01pt2", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}]}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 5, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n4le03ob05re5vqz01pt3", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "Watch this video carefully. Take notes when necessary."}]}, "type": "video"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}